# AWS networking

Do not open SSH (22) or RDP (3389) to 0.0.0.0/0 without a written justification
in the change and user confirmation. Prefer existing bastion, VPN, or prefix
lists the repository already uses.

Match existing VPC, subnet, and security-group modules. Do not create a
parallel network layout for a one-off resource.

Review new ingress rules for ports and CIDRs against the environment
(dev/stage/prod) already named in the stack.
